          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಪರೂಪಕ್ಕೆ (aparūpakke) is aparūpa, \"rare\", with -kke, \"for\": \"rarely\". Aparūpa is usually traced to Sanskrit apūrva, \"unprecedented\" (CDIAL 494), but no source settles it."
